/*
    Package eden_input, version 1: Input state sampled by the host once per host frame. Buttons are a device-independent pad the host maps from keyboard and gamepad; keys are PC set-1 scan codes (the values of DirectInput DIK_* and of Eden's KeyCode).

    The host implements EdenInputHost (every field must be set; abi_link_eden_input
    refuses a null one) and links it into an instance. Each
    implementation receives the runtime (for AbiBytes access) and the
    instance id (the key of any per-instance state it keeps). To fail
    the guest it calls abi_trap(message) and returns.
*/


